  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.84,
   "text": "Hook 1."
  },
  {
   "start": 2.9,
   "end": 6.04,
   "text": "Delete Obsidian because Claude just solved its biggest problem and built itself a second"
  },
  {
   "start": 6.04,
   "end": 6.4,
   "text": "brain."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.46,
   "end": 8.06,
   "text": "Hook 2."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.06,
   "end": 11.92,
   "text": "Most people don't realize that Claude just released a second brain for Claude."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.6,
   "end": 15.1,
   "text": "Cut cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 17.12,
   "end": 18.06,
   "text": "Hook 2."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.66,
   "end": 20.58,
   "text": "Most people don't realize that Anthropic just released an..."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.58,
   "end": 21.46,
   "text": "Cut cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.54,
   "end": 23.18,
   "text": "Hook 2."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.64,
   "end": 26.4,
   "text": "Most people don't realize that Anthropic just released an official second brain for"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.4,
   "end": 26.7,
   "text": "Claude."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.88,
   "end": 28.54,
   "text": "Cut cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.54,
   "end": 29.6,
   "text": "Hook 2."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.38,
   "end": 33.14,
   "text": "Most people don't realize that Enthrobic just released an official second brain for"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.14,
   "end": 33.4,
   "text": "Claude."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.58,
   "end": 35.04,
   "text": "Hook 3."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.7,
   "end": 38.76,
   "text": "So, Enthrobic just quietly dropped an object that turns Claude into a literal second"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.76,
   "end": 39.12,
   "text": "brain."
  },
  {
   "start": 43.58,
   "end": 45.92,
   "text": "Now I'm going to go to the body section here."
  },
  {
   "start": 47.0,
   "end": 48.56,
   "text": "This is insane because now- cut cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 49.08,
   "end": 52.28,
   "text": "This is insane because it now automatically remembers your projects and preferences across"
  },
  {
   "start": 52.28,
   "end": 53.42,
   "text": "every single conversation."
  },
  {
   "start": 54.58,
   "end": 58.52,
   "text": "If you use Claude- cut cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 58.52,
   "end": 60.74,
   "text": "important details every time you switch chats."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.04,
   "end": 66.58,
   "text": "Now, cloud saves details, cut cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 67.4,
   "end": 68.66,
   "text": "Now cloud saves, cut cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 69.1,
   "end": 70.36,
   "text": "Now cloud saves, cut cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.88,
   "end": 72.82,
   "text": "Now cloud saves details, cut cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 73.16,
   "end": 75.4,
   "text": "Now cloud saves details dynamically in the background."
  },
  {
   "start": 76.7,
   "end": 79.82,
   "text": "So you can go into your settings and literally see your memories categorized by topic."
  },
  {
   "start": 80.16,
   "end": 83.1,
   "text": "You can click on any file to edit the details or delete things you don't want it"
  },
  {
   "start": 83.1,
   "end": 84.06,
   "text": "to forget, cut cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 84.62,
   "end": 87.46,
   "text": "You can click on any file to edit the details or delete things."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.74,
   "end": 91.02,
   "text": "Cut cut. You can click on any file to edit the details or delete any things you"
  },
  {
   "start": 91.02,
   "end": 91.6,
   "text": "wanted to forget."
  },
  {
   "start": 93.64,
   "end": 95.2,
   "text": "It even works across the web desktop app."
  },
  {
   "start": 95.56,
   "end": 98.8,
   "text": "Cut cut. It even works across the web desktop app and mobile for..."
  },
  {
   "start": 98.8,
   "end": 104.92,
   "text": "Cut cut. It even works in your browser across the desktop app and even on mobile"
  },
  {
   "start": 104.92,
   "end": 105.68,
   "text": "for all users."
  },
  {
   "start": 107.6,
   "end": 109.82,
   "text": "Now this completely changes how you use Clod."
  },
  {
   "start": 112.86,
   "end": 113.6,
   "text": "Cut cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 114.66,
   "end": 117.16,
   "text": "But there's one major catch you need to know before you turn this on."
  },
  {
   "start": 117.48,
   "end": 117.66,
   "text": "Cut, cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 117.94,
   "end": 119.84,
   "text": "Okay, cut this entire past two sentences."
  },
  {
   "start": 119.98,
   "end": 121.94,
   "text": "I'm going to re-say it and now this completely changes how you use Clod."
  },
  {
   "start": 122.54,
   "end": 125.52,
   "text": "Now this completely changes how you use Clod, but there's one major catch you need"
  },
  {
   "start": 125.52,
   "end": 127.08,
   "text": "to know before you turn this on."
  },
  {
   "start": 129.12,
   "end": 131.6,
   "text": "The shared memory only works if you run Clod co-work in the cloud."
  },
  {
   "start": 131.8,
   "end": 132.16,
   "text": "So if you..."
  },
  {
   "start": 132.16,
   "end": 132.82,
   "text": "Cut, cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 133.8,
   "end": 134.66,
   "text": "The shared memory..."
  },
  {
   "start": 134.66,
   "end": 135.14,
   "text": "Cut, cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 135.48,
   "end": 137.78,
   "text": "The shared memory only works if you run Clod co-work in the cloud."
  },
  {
   "start": 137.86,
   "end": 140.0,
   "text": "So if you say your tasks to run locally on machine..."
  },
  {
   "start": 140.0,
   "end": 140.36,
   "text": "Cut, cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 141.88,
   "end": 145.5,
   "text": "Cut out the part that says this shared memory only works if you run Cloud Core in the cloud."
  },
  {
   "start": 146.84,
   "end": 148.38,
   "text": "So if you say you're tasked to run locally on your..."
  },
  {
   "start": 148.38,
   "end": 148.66,
   "text": "Cut cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 150.24,
   "end": 152.84,
   "text": "If you say you're tasked to run locally on your machine, the memory won't sync"
  },
  {
   "start": 152.84,
   "end": 154.14,
   "text": "because it only works in the cloud."
  },
  {
   "start": 156.2,
   "end": 157.24,
   "text": "Comment mem for the free setup."
  }
